== Trivia ==
* Currently, there is a glitch where it does not face the unit it is stunning. This may have been fixed.
* There was a glitch  where even if it dies, the units near it will keep getting stunned even if it gets unstunned by [[Medic Cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone|Camera Repair Drone.]] This has been fixed.
* This enemy is based on the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Skull_Dismantler_Skibidi_Toilet Skull Dismantler Skibidi Toilet].

